  "lowerNotes": {
    "value": "<b>Energy Track</b>: Each undamaged box generates one die, allocated between <b>Move</b>, <b>Attack</b> & <b>Repair</b>. Destroyed or captured ships vanish.<br><b>Attack</b>: <b>Bolt of Tzeentch</b>, Range 9\", 0-6 die attack. May not repel boarders. No save modifiers.<br><b>Repair</b>: Roll energy dice at start of <i>Battle Phase</i>, <b>Energy Track</b> repairs one box on a <b>5-6</b><br><b>Boarding</b>: Killed enemy crew transform to <b>Pink Horrors</b> on a 4+ (max crew 4).",
    "scale": 0.55,
